# r1113 rerun boot AR: the r1113ra world restarted again (same OUT as rerun_a / rerun_a2, level r1113ra, group A superflat).
# Why (perf/runs/r1113/verdicts/rerun_a.md):
#   SQ-HH-1551b, SQ-HH-1555h: rerun_a2 spawned no player, and forceloaded chunks with no player within 128 blocks get no
#     random ticks (gotchas.md), so neither hops plant could grow. Same rows with a bot standing next to them.
#   SQ-WO-06r: rerun_a saw the storm sleep, but the tree woke and fell asleep again on a tired roll (sleep_until 14027 =
#     game 8027 + 300 s) before the single read 120 s after the clear. Polled every 5 s here.
#   SQ-HH-501d: diagnostic only (the r1113 FAIL stands): same theft with the default carry time, to see whether the crow
#     reaches the nest late once it lands within 3 blocks of the nest height (TODO largecontent/mod-additions #68).
# Config in OUT/srv before the boot (server stopped):
#   hearthandharvest-common.toml: hopsRequireFarmland = false (still false after rerun_a2; grep it), stealChance 1.0 (kept),
#   carryTicks back to the default:
#   python3 tools/scratch_query/qrun.py toml OUT/srv/config/hearthandharvest-common.toml crow carryTicks 1200
#   After this boot reset hopsRequireFarmland to true (and carryTicks to 200 if group A crow rows follow on this world).
# Probes: already in OUT/srv/kubejs/server_scripts/ (zz_wo_probe.js, zz_hh_crow_probe.js, zz_zq_probe.js).
pace 1

