> kill @e[type=hearthandharvest:crow,x=31107,y=-61,z=30087,dx=26,dy=14,dz=26]
expect \[zhh3\] invcount b501 minecraft:gold_ingot 3
look RECORD: nest Inventory and CrowStash; if stashed, the sample where goals shows CrowSeekShinyGoal again and the crow's y versus -60 (within 3 = nearbyNest finds it); if not, where the gold went (carry ends at 1200)
